on't know who Eric Masterson is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-16T11:07:39-07:00","id":199124,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thunderstrike_(Eric_Masterson)\" target=\"_blank\">Thunderstrike (Eric Masterson)</a><br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/6/60/Thunderstrike.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-16T11:24:49-07:00","id":199129,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epimetheus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/65267-let-s-talk-comics?p=198693#post198693\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Rather than reintroduce Stephanie Brown they decided to go and make Batgirl into a hipster rather than oracle. Fuck DC.</div> </div> </div> </div>They reintroduced Stephanie Brown back in April.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-16T12:54:17-07:00","id":199179,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/65267-let-s-talk-comics?p=199129#post199129\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They reintroduced Stephanie Brown back in April.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not as batgirl which honestly if you were going to have batgirl on the title it should be the one who's 17 not the one who's 20ish and as dry as toast.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","name":"Epimetheus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1758"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-16T12:55:46-07:00","id":199182,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Odd_Canuck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/65267-let-s-talk-comics?p=198941#post198941\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So.... no discussion about Thor being a title and/or the New Thor yet?</div> </div> </div> </div>You mean how wolverine is going to die for REALZ THIS TIME!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! Yeah I'm sorry this is a pointless PR Stunt that happens every so often.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","name":"Epimetheus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1758"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-16T13:48:11-07:00","id":199224,"title":"","content":"Batman's back was broken.....until it wasn't.<br /> Superman was dead.....until he wasn't.<br /> Spider-Man was a clone.....until he wasn't.<br /> Thor was a frog.....until he wasn't.<br /> Wonder Woman lost her powers.....until she got them back and forgot about the whole thing.<br /> Storm lost her powers.....until she got them back.<br /> Wolverine lost his adamantium.......until he got it back.<br /> Hal Jordan, Barry Allen, Bucky Barnes and Jason Todd were all dead......until they weren't.<br /> <br /> Yeah, I think we're all kinda jaded about it at this point.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-16T14:46:40-07:00","id":199296,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epimetheus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/65267-let-s-talk-comics?p=199179#post199179\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not as Batgirl, which, honestly, if you were going to have Batgirl on the title, it should be the one who's seventeen, not the one who's twenty-ish and as dry as toast.</div> </div> </div> </div>Epimetheus, I really wasn't kidding when I asked you before. Do you like comics? Is there anything in comics you actually like? You don't have to answer if you don't want, but I asked because I want to know.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-16T17:06:53-07:00","id":199429,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hand-of-Omega</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/65267-let-s-talk-comics?p=195244#post195244\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sims doesn't get into it much in that article, but I think his comments around the end, about how &quot;grown up and mature&quot; DC wants to appear is really apparent in the movies they're making now. This desire has been passed on to Warner Bros, which seems to be what led one of their presidents to remark how a Green Lantern sequel would have to be &quot;darker and edgier&quot;...<br /> <br /> Unfortunately, the Dark Knight movies were such a success, that Warners' doesn't seem to realize that what goes for the DK does not automatically work for ALL their superheroes! Whether you call it trying to be like Marvel, or just trying to be &quot;dark and mature&quot;, that approach just does not fit those characters.<br /> <br /> Ironically, Marvel is, if anything, embracing the DC approach: Their movies are so successful now, I believe, because they are NOT dark and grim, but openly fun and (relatively) light-hearted! The Avengers, in tone, felt almost like a JLA story (notice how colorful the costumes were)! If DC/Warners really wants to compete, they should get back to their own basics...<br /> <br /> Of course, they'd probably misinterpret that, and go full-on Camp comedy or something...<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Ugh, it's so frustrating, because it's SO easy for Warners to get these characters RIGHT, and yet they insist on driving them off a cliff instead...<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I'm with you. As much I like the first two Nolan Batman movies(Rises not so much), not every character needs to be dark and gritty. I love the Marvel movies because they are just plain fun. I like a dark superhero, but they don't all need to be that way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-16T17:13:08-07:00","id":199444,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/65267-let-s-talk-comics?p=199224#post199224\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Batman's back was broken.....until it wasn't.<br /> Superman was dead.....until he wasn't.<br /> Spider-Man was a clone.....until he wasn't.<br /> Thor was a frog.....until he wasn't.<br /> Wonder Woman lost her powers.....until she got them back and forgot about the whole thing.<br /> Storm lost her powers.....until she got them back.<br /> Wolverine lost his adamantium.......until he got it back.<br /> Hal Jordan, Barry Allen, Bucky Barnes and Jason Todd were all dead......until they weren't.<br /> <br /> Yeah, I think we're all kinda jaded about it at this point.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was just thinking that...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-16T21:43:02-07:00","id":199657,"title":"","content":"So Falcon is Captain America now, does that mean that Iron Man is secretly gay. Oh well, no Hispanic or Asian retcon for us then since we running out of Iconic Avenger.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-16T21:45:55-07:00","id":199659,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/65267-let-s-talk-comics?p=199657#post199657\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So Falcon is Captain America now, does that mean that Iron Man is secretly gay. Oh well, no Hispanic or Asian retcon for us then since we running out of Iconic Avenger.</div> </div> </div> </div>...I don't get it. Are you complaining about Captain America being black?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-16T21:50:43-07:00","id":199664,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/65267-let-s-talk-comics?p=199296#post199296\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Epimetheus, I really wasn't kidding when I asked you before. Do you like comics? Is there anything in comics you actually like? You don't have to answer if you don't want, but I asked because I want to know.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes. I like comics. I just like complaining about them on this thread. X-Factors good. Earth 2 was good before the writer stormed out. Superior Foes is good. I just find it easier to talk about my issues with comics. Bendis ruining something I once loved. Oracle being erased for Batgirl. Woman-Thor PR stunt these are things I can talk about more easily because it's recent and fresh in my mind. Most of the comics I like are few and far between. New Teen Titans looks like it has a promising start but seriously. But things you dislike always tend to be more pronounced than things you like.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","name":"Epimetheus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1758"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-16T22:01:11-07:00","id":199672,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/65267-let-s-talk-comics?p=199659#post199659\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...I don't get it. Are you complaining about Captain America being black?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm just joking since two out of the three Avengers are minority now (woman and black), they just need Tony to be gay so the set can be complete.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-16T22:06:20-07:00","id":199677,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/65267-let-s-talk-comics?p=199224#post199224\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Batman's back was broken.....until it wasn't.<br /> Superman was dead.....until he wasn't.<br /> Spider-Man was a clone.....until he wasn't.<br /> Thor was a frog.....until he wasn't.<br /> Wonder Woman lost her powers.....until she got them back and forgot about the whole thing.<br /> Storm lost her powers.....until she got them back.<br /> Wolverine lost his adamantium.......until he got it back.<br /> Hal Jordan, Barry Allen, Bucky Barnes and Jason Todd were all dead......until they weren't.<br /> <br /> Yeah, I think we're all kinda jaded about it at this point.</div> </div> </div> </div>When your stories don't have real endings, it's very hard to commit to real consequences for long.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T09:07:28-07:00","id":200073,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/65267-let-s-talk-comics?p=199429#post199429\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm with you. As much I like the first two Nolan Batman movies(Rises not so much), not every character needs to be dark and gritty. I love the Marvel movies because they are just plain fun. I like a dark superhero, but they don't all need to be that way.</div> </div> </div> </div>That is my problem. If every hero is dark then really none of them are they are just normal. And really it has been done into the ground. You hear &quot;well it sells&quot;, but if you are not trying anything else can you actually say it sells that well. Why not go out on a limb, and I don't know, have a classic hero. Not everyone hates good guys. How about try an anti anti-hero for the novelty.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/65267-let-s-talk-comics?p=199659#post199659\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...I don't get it. Are you complaining about Captain America being black?</div> </div> </div> </div>I am. Just like I did when DC made Alan Scott gay and I have the same issues with Thor being female. While it isn't quite the same thing as GL since they are not retconning, it feels the same cheap &quot;lets do this for the controversy&quot;. The same lets make Starfire a mega slut now in spite of the fact that a lot of kids now read her. If it is really about having a Black Superhero why not make one?<br /> <br /> I'm not saying Blade and Black Panther have to be the only major black Superheroes, just there is no point at this time in this way. They are seeing a major resurgence with the movies and this has been their chance to really make these major characters again. Hell, Falcon picked up a lot of interest because of the last Cap movie. I'm not saying that because of the change they can't be major characters, just that any change has a higher potential of losing the people you were just getting involved in the first place.<br /> <br /> It also doesn't feel like it is being done for good reasons. In that it feels too much as if they were going to parade a woman and a black man on stage and say it was an example of equality. Totally missing the point that if you are parading them around like a side show then it isn't about equality.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forever and always forward.<br /> Don't ask why that came to mind or that I felt the need to post it.<br /> I see the incorporeally challenged.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/787-sorwen","name":"Sorwen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T09:26:14-07:00","id":200087,"title":"","content":"Basically you're looking at the entire package when buying into a character. If part of that package changes it can be a deal breaker if it seems too extreme. Considering how sales are affected with such changes, I'd say you're not alone.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T09:55:32-07:00","id":200147,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorwen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/65267-let-s-talk-comics?p=200073#post200073\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am [complaining about Captain America being black].</div> </div> </div> </div>So if they'd replaced him with another white man, you would not be complaining?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T10:04:23-07:00","id":200161,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/65267-let-s-talk-comics?p=200147#post200147\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So if they'd replaced him with another white man, you would not be complaining?</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"http://marvel.com/universe/Captain_America_%28James_Barnes%29\" target=\"_blank\">They did that already and people complained.</a><br /> <br /> Maybe they can make it like the whole Batman &quot;franchise&quot; they've been using over at DC.<br /> <br /> There's not just one Captain America anymore. America is diverse, let's make the costumed rep diverse.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T10:41:25-07:00","id":200238,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/65267-let-s-talk-comics?p=200161#post200161\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <a href=\"http://marvel.com/universe/Captain_America_%28James_Barnes%29\" target=\"_blank\">They did that already and people complained.</a><br /> <br /> Maybe they can make it like the whole Batman &quot;franchise&quot; they've been using over at DC.<br /> <br /> There's not just one Captain America anymore. America is diverse, let's make the costumed rep diverse.</div> </div> </div> </div>There is already some existing characters to serve as a foundation if they want to go that route. Batman has a lot more, Robins, Red Robin, Batgirls, Batwoman, Nightwing, Black Bat, Batwing, and so on. Cap doesn't have that much, but American Agent and, more importantly, Patriot can serve as a decent base to go for expanding the Cap-related roster of American-symbol heroes if Marvel decides to go that way.<br /> <br /> That said, everything in Marvel seems to happen around the same 4 or 5 properties. I'd rather have some work done on creating and establishing real new characters, outside of New York, unrelated to X-people / Avengers / Spider-people/ gamma-people, getting their own rogues gallery and supporting cast, going mostly free from crossovers at least for the first year.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T10:53:40-07:00","id":200253,"title":"","content":"A couple of titles I once thought were a breath of fresh air were Alpha Flight and the Thunderbolts. And at first they were just that to me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T11:15:05-07:00","id":200267,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/65267-let-s-talk-comics?p=200161#post200161\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They [replaced Cap with another white man] already and people complained.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, but I'm asking Sorwen because--and my apologies to him for talking about him like he's not in the room, so to speak--Sorwen's post confuses me a little. At first he makes it sound like Cap's blackness is the reason he's complaining, but then he makes it sound like the publicity stunt is why, and I'm trying to narrow down what it's actually about.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T11:40:06-07:00","id":200285,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/65267-let-s-talk-comics?p=200147#post200147\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So if they'd replaced him with another white man, you would not be complaining?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, I would complain about that too if for similar and different reasons. Similar in that changing characters right now makes zero sense with the rise of Cap due to the movies. Having Bucky become Cap again would be just as counter intuitive to me. I would be scratching my head thinking &quot;Why the fuck?&quot;. Then add to that they are making him black which feels off at this time on top of the change. I really don't think they would be changing him right now just to throw another white guy in.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/65267-let-s-talk-comics?p=200267#post200267\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, but I'm asking Sorwen because--and my apologies to him for talking about him like he's not in the room, so to speak--Sorwen's post confuses me a little. At first he makes it sound like Cap's blackness is the reason he's complaining, but then he makes it sound like the publicity stunt is why, and I'm trying to narrow down what it's actually about.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes. I think you differentiate between the two intents where in this case I think it is all in one. I don't think they would be changing to some different white guy right now. I think his being black is the point. If you are asking do I have a problem with a black superhero then the answer is no. I don't see it as a separate question in this case, because of why I perceive they did it. If they actually mean differently(vs the fact they will say the mean differently) well in my instance they made a poor case of it. Another way to put it is I would have been just as angry/off-put/whatever if when they made those Blade movies if they made him white. I think if they did it would have been for the same reasons.<br /> <br /> Does that make sense or did I just confuse the issue more?<br /> <br /> <br /> Edit: Change &quot;No&quot; to &quot;Yes&quot; so that it might make more sense.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forever and always forward.<br /> Don't ask why that came to mind or that I felt the need to post it.<br /> I see the incorporeally challenged.","edited":{"userid":787,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/787-sorwen","user":"Sorwen","date":". 07-17-2014, 02:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/787-sorwen","name":"Sorwen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T14:48:19-07:00","id":200413,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorwen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/65267-let-s-talk-comics?p=200073#post200073\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That is my problem. If every hero is dark then really none of them are they are just normal. And really it has been done into the ground. You hear &quot;well it sells&quot;, but if you are not trying anything else can you actually say it sells that well. Why not go out on a limb, and I don't know, have a classic hero. Not everyone hates good guys. How about try an anti anti-hero for the novelty.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I am. Just like I did when DC made Alan Scott gay and I have the same issues with Thor being female. While it isn't quite the same thing as GL since they are not retconning, it feels the same cheap &quot;lets do this for the controversy&quot;. The same lets make Starfire a mega slut now in spite of the fact that a lot of kids now read her. If it is really about having a Black Superhero why not make one?</div> </div> </div> </div>DC making Alan Scott gay was fine because it was an alternate universe. If Thor was a woman in the ultimates universe it would be fine as well because there's still a chance for these characters to come back in the main universe (Though probably not as they were probably chosen because DC didn't have any direct plans for them) Though yes I have an issue with using a long standing character and changing their race simply because the writers are lazy. It's annoying. It's the issue I have with Nu 52 Wally West who they are making black because of the TV series which TV series should not effect a Comic book that's bullshit.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","name":"Epimetheus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1758"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T15:44:49-07:00","id":200449,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epimetheus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/65267-let-s-talk-comics?p=200413#post200413\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">DC making Alan Scott gay was fine because it was an alternate universe. If Thor was a woman in the ultimates universe it would be fine as well because there's still a chance for these characters to come back in the main universe (Though probably not as they were probably chosen because DC didn't have any direct plans for them) Though yes I have an issue with using a long standing character and changing their race simply because the writers are lazy. It's annoying. <b>It's the issue I have with Nu 52 Wally West who they are making black because of the TV series which TV series should not effect a Comic book that's bullshit</b>.</div> </div> </div> </div>I didn't know about that last part.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forever and always forward.<br /> Don't ask why that came to mind or that I felt the need to post it.<br /> I see the incorporeally challenged.","edited":{"userid":787,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/787-sorwen","user":"Sorwen","date":". 07-17-2014, 06:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/787-sorwen","name":"Sorwen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T16:54:50-07:00","id":200527,"title":"","content":"Considering the lengthy history that Sam Wilson has with Steve Rogers, I'm ok with Wilson as Cap. I'm pretty sure it's a temporary gig, but with their past, it's kinda like they're brothers anyway sharing the same long-johns.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T19:41:25-07:00","id":200662,"title":"","content":"But we all know this is just temporary, right ? Marvel pretty much gonna restore everyone back into their original role when Avengers 2 comes out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T19:45:50-07:00","id":200665,"title":"","content":"Yeah, it probably wouldn't look good if Ultron got beat up by a girl anyway.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T21:19:15-07:00","id":200701,"title":"","content":"Gotta say, the Avengers lineup they got with the new Thor, new Cap and &quot;new&quot; Iron-Man is not looking good for me, in terms of visual design.<br /> <br /> Medusa is ok but nothing to write home about. Probably better with less jewelry. Wanda is OK, Scott too. BIazing dude is acceptable, though I'd prefer it if he got proper pants (unless he somehow torns them apart when he transforms, like the hulk, for some reason). I actually really like Doc Strange's outfit<br /> <br /> New Thor's didn't impress me, a bit overdesigned for my taste. Falcaptain America's design is also too busy for my taste. Not too fond of Deathlok either. Winter Soldier wears normal clothing (well, normal military clothing), which I don't like in super heroes. White-armored Iron Man is not to my taste either, I think the Red and Gold is still best (though I can admit there is too much red in this team already), and the armor design is not all that good either.<br /> <br /> Then there is the blazing guy who became a superhero, like, a week ago and is already an Avenger, wearing torn up pants that somehow don't catch on fire.<br /> <br /> <b>And</b> they have Angela (urgh) in there. With her being revealed as Thor's (the original, I think) sister, she will likely be in a lot more Avengers and Thor stories than I'd like (which would be none).<br /> <br /> Unless this thing starts getting a lot of reviews praising excellent writing, I probably wont be buying.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://img2.timeinc.net/ew/i/2014/07/15/avengers-now_1000x791.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T21:25:25-07:00","id":200703,"title":"","content":"Why do you not like normal clothes on superheroes, Danel?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T21:32:39-07:00","id":200710,"title":"","content":"I have to say, I kind of agree about the visual design complaints. If I didn't already know who those people are, the only ones my guesses would even come close on are Thor, Captain America, and Ant-Man. If danelsan hadn't said which ones Medusa and Dethlok are, I wouldn't have known, and I still don't know who flamey guy is, but I like to guess his codename is Truth. Why? Because his pants are not on fire.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T21:41:34-07:00","id":200727,"title":"","content":"I am...okay with Cap's new costume. I don't love it, I don't hate it. I dislike plating on superhero costumes as a general rule, but at least the plating on his chest is evocative of wings, which I think is a cute callback to his old role as Falcon. The boots look pretty much military. I think either all the black coloring is a little bit on the nose or it's intended to be a more stealth-oriented suit than Cap Classic, but either way I don't think it works super well. I kind of like that he has a hair-exposing mask just so he looks like he has a black person's hair and not a white person's hair, but I could honestly take it or leave it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T21:53:12-07:00","id":200735,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/65267-let-s-talk-comics?p=200703#post200703\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why do you not like normal clothes on superheroes, Danel?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not sure that is something I can articulate properly...especial costumes are just something I strongly associate with superheroes. It would be like watching a major Lucha Libre event in Mexico and the participants don't have masks, it just wouldn't be right. Special clothing is a huge aspect of the genre for me and things normal people wear, even when normal people include soldiers, are just not special enough for me.<br /> <br /> There is also a hint of feeling that realistic outfits like Winter Soldier's military fatigues ground the character too much in reality, which doesn't work for me when the guy has a cyborg arm and most of the team around him uses jewelry, spandex, fantasy armor, sci-fi materials and so on.<br /> <br /> <b>Edit</b>: and yet, there are a lot of little particularities in my preferences that make them sometimes contradictory.<br /> <br /> I don't like the ladies to have high heels if they don't have some power that makes it a non-issue, such as flight. I don't like heroes and heroines without especial protective powers, especially street level, to have a lot of exposed skin, but I make exceptions for exposed heads and a few designs I have being fond of from before my preferences started to get more narrow.<br /> Then I didn't like when Superman got an armored look in his new costume, because he is already invulnerable enough, damn it, and the costume got too detailed and lost a lot of the iconic appeal.<br /> And so on. A lot of little rules and rules-exception that sometimes I don't even know I have until some costume makes them appear.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":868,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","user":"danelsan","date":". 07-18-2014, 01:07 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-18T04:43:02-07:00","id":201012,"title":"","content":"I think She-Thor's armor looks dumb.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>A Green Sun Destrier</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/77-kongurous","name":"kongurous","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar77_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"417"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-18T05:51:52-07:00","id":201035,"title":"","content":"The six-boobs-chainmail that Thor wear would look ridiculous on a girl thought (as demonstrated by Ultimate Valkyrie).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-18T06:16:39-07:00","id":201042,"title":"","content":"This is a bit petty even for me, but...is Dethlok holding a power drill? With a flathead screwdriver attachment? He's posing like one of Charlie's Angels, but the instrument he's holding looks to me like his mission is to install a new screen door.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","ra