 thin away).<br /> <br /> 5) There is nothing redeeming in Bucky's or Cap's outfits. They both look bad to me.<br /> <br /> 6) I know Dr. Strange isn't a muscular kind of character, but that is really bad. Though when you call Bucky and Cap muscular I guess your contrast is someone that small.<br /> <br /> 7) Never liked Ant man so I can say I don't hate his outfit more than I've ever have in the past.<br /> <br /> 8) I can't figure if the Flame guy wants to be the Human Torch, Hulk, or Ghost Rider. And can't care which he wants to be.<br /> <br /> 9) Cyborg with a 60's space gun?<br /> <br /> 10) Angel. I've been really sad since they first showed her new look. It didn't have to be her old look, but couldn't they have come up with something better?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forever and always forward.<br /> Don't ask why that came to mind or that I felt the need to post it.<br /> I see the incorporeally challenged.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/787-sorwen","name":"Sorwen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-18T13:36:52-07:00","id":201422,"title":"","content":"I guess Medusa is not much armor as it is jewelry. You know, playing up that she is royalty (or former royalty, or royalty in exile or whatever is going on with the inhumans these days, I'm not keeping tabs on it)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" tar