because I'm too world-weary to <i>need </i>the lessons they're hammering home. Maybe it <i>is </i>substandard writing. Maybe it's because the same bunch of goobers that were in the comic book stores with me are the putzes who are in charge now and writing the same crap they grew up with. I don't know.<br /> <br /> What I do know is that I miss the Spider-Man who was married and happy with MJ and didn't hang out with the Avengers and didn't brood over the fake parents who came back and tortured him or the fake Aunt May who died or the real Norman Osborn who didn't. I miss the Batman who responds to &quot;Who are you?&quot; with a simple and scary &quot;I'm Batman.&quot; and do not care for the one who says, &quot;I'm the goddamned Batman!&quot;. I miss Hulk Speak and HULK SMASH!. I miss Wolverine being a failed samurai who keeps trying and doesn't know jack about his past. I miss Green Arrow being a hot-headed malcontent and his buddy Green Lantern having to come save his ass regularly.<br /> <br /> <br /> Sorry, got off on a rant there. tl;dr......it's not the same.</div> </div> </div> </div>I am totally with you man...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","v