th at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-05T11:01:23-07:00","id":249948,"title":"","content":"There really aren't any rules about what's okay to discuss. Talk about what you want, though I have no idea if anyone in this thread has enough knowledge of Japanese and/or Franco-Belgian comics to engage you on the topic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-05T11:25:49-07:00","id":249965,"title":"","content":"We can always talk about Batman.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-05T11:41:11-07:00","id":249979,"title":"","content":"So, how reliable is this Hitfix? Because I'm considerably hesitant to trust what passes for journalism on the internet, especially on such rumor-mill-happy subjects such as the movie industry.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-05T13:53:08-07:00","id":250101,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>danelsan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/65267-let-s-talk-comics?p=249979#post249979\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, how reliable is this Hitfix? Because I'm considerably hesitant to trust what passes for journalism on the internet, especially on such rumor-mill-happy subjects such as the movie industry.</div> </div> </div> </div>Always take anything with a<a href=\"http://gb.fotolibra.com/images/previews/666334-salt-mountain.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\"> grain of salt</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-05T14:57:35-07:00","id":250153,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/65267-let-s-talk-comics?p=249118#post249118\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmmm, I wonder if Fox's contract is due up by 2015..........</div> </div> </div> </div>Not from what I read on another site. They at least have First Class Apocalypse that is in pre-production I think and then another Wolverine movie was announced to come after that.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/65267-let-s-talk-comics?p=249174#post249174\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I went to the comic shop today, and by coincidence the guys there were talking about this. Now, I have no idea if any of this is true, but the story they were telling is back when Marvel filed for bankruptcy, Fox used their superior position to essentially get a reverse George Lucas deal, so they get royalties on pretty much any and all X-Men merchandise. Disney isn't cool with this, so they're trying to starve Fox out by having Marvel cut as much X-Men property as possible so Fox will lose money on the deal and revert the movie rights back to Marvel, so Disney won't have to pay Bill O'Reilly and Megyn Kelly every time someone buys a Wolverine poster.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can't quite believe that one. I kind of believe the first part in that Fox got the rights during the almost bankruptcy. However it has only ever been said the movie rights and no deal for merch. Also Marvel has been using the heck out of him with special appearances on their cartoon shows.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forever and always forward.<br /> Don't ask why that came to mind or that I felt the need to post it.<br /> I see the incorporeally challenged.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/787-sorwen","name":"Sorwen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-05T17:25:27-07:00","id":250239,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/65267-let-s-talk-comics?p=249828#post249828\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I saw that and am flabbergasted. I guess I shouldn't have put it past them to come up with some new way to make me hate a movie I haven't even seen, but I did, and well, this is the fuckin' result.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yea, I'm pretty pissed about it too.<br /> <br /> Wish I knew what was in their heads....actually I probably don't want to know. Idiots...<br /> <br /> I mean, not every DCU character is Batman, nor should they be. Thats one of the reasons I didn't like Man of Steel. Superman is not Batman...Batman can be brooding, Superman shouldn't be.<br /> <br /> Hell, how they hell can they pull off The Flash if he can't crack a joke? WTH?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":24,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","user":"Mr Gone","date":". 09-05-2014, 08:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-05T18:06:16-07:00","id":250257,"title":"","content":"<di